OL,3,GNEWSAPolice patrols after people keep
OL,4,Abreaking into care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are patrolling a derelict care
OL,7,Fhome every day after people started
OL,8,Fbreaking into the building again.
OL,10,FDurham Police said it had repeatedly
OL,11,Ftried to secure Feryemount House in
OL,12,FFerryhill, County Durham, but new ways
OL,13,Finto the building were often
OL,14,Fdiscovered, sometimes as soon as the
OL,15,Ffollowing day.
OL,17,FDurham County Council was in the
OL,18,Fprocess of buying the former care home
OL,19,Fback after councillors agreed to the
OL,20,Fmove in September, with plans to knock
OL,21,Fit down.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
