OL,3,GNEWSAPolice patrols after people keep
OL,4,Abreaking into care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reform UK-led council's acting
OL,7,Fsafer places manager Derek Robson said
OL,8,Fit had become a "blight on the town and
OL,9,Fa magnet for anti-social behaviour",
OL,10,Fadding it was working on securing the
OL,11,Fbuilding until its demolition.
